  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築開發投資與設計決策",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT AND DESIGN STRATEGY",
    "describe_ch": "建築開發投資是一項牽涉非常廣域且複雜的行為，本課程旨在闡述建築開發相關面向1.建築產業趨勢：社會政策、市場供需2.都市環境：公共設施、交通運輸3.經濟議題：產業結構、經營管理、財務分析4.建築規劃：土地政策、建築法規；進而掌握投資風險的重要關鍵，建立建築規劃與設計決策之重要判斷準則。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to explore and understand: 1) Industry trends: Government policy, supply and demand in terms of market economy; 2) Urban environment: Public facilities, transportation; 3) Economic issues: Industry structure, operation and management, financial analysis; and 4) Planning: Land policy, code and regulation. The aforementioned aspects and factors constitute the grounds for risk and opportunity assessment, further, to formulate a set of design and real estate investment criteria.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
